# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Journeyman (75-150)
section Leatherworking 75-150

step Journeyman Leatherworking
  tip Journeyman raises the cap from 75 to 150 for 5s; it needs Leatherworking 50 and character level 10, so you can take it on any visit from 50. Not every Leatherworking trainer teaches it: Alliance Aayndia Floralwind (Ashenvale), Emerii Tallgust (Zephras Isle), Faldron (Darnassus), Fimble Finespindle (Ironforge) and Simon Tanner (Stormwind City); Horde Arthur Moore (Undercity), Brawn (Stranglethorn Vale), Emerii Tallgust (Zephras Isle), Karolek (Orgrimmar), Krulmoo Fullmoon (The Barrens), Narv Hidecrafter (Desolace) and Tarn (Thunder Bluff). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: Fine Leather Belt (from 55, 3s). 75-150 takes about 15s 50c of recipes and 57s of vendor goods, plus 144 Medium Leather, 24 Elixir of Minor Agility and 321 Heavy Leather to gather or buy.
  level 10
  train Leatherworking Journeyman
  learn 3763

