  tip Heavy Armor Kit is orange at 125 (yellow 145, green 155, grey 165): about 26 crafts to 150. Each takes 5 Heavy Leather and 1 Fine Thread. Five Heavy Leather a craft (beasts of level 28-40); the kits sell to vendors. Leatherworking 150 is a Legacy System milestone.
