step Expert Leatherworking
  zone Azeroth
  tip Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225; it needs Leatherworking 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance Telonis (Darnassus); Horde Una (Thunder Bluff). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: Cured Heavy Hide (from 125, 5s) and Barbaric Shoulders (from 150). 150-225 takes about 5s of recipes and 7g 87s of vendor goods, plus 22 Heavy Hide and 373 Thick Leather to gather or buy. Come with all of it in your bags (the steps above, the rest from the Auction House): these trainers also teach Guardian Gloves (from 165) and Nightscape Headband (from 180), and the crafts need no station, so craft right here and learn each recipe as you reach its skill. One trip instead of 3. Nightscape Pants (from 210) takes a second trip, to other trainers (below).
  level 20
  train Leatherworking Expert
  learn 3818
  learn 7151

