step Rugged Armor Kit to 239
  tip Rugged Armor Kit is yellow at 225 (yellow 225, green 235, grey 245): about 23 crafts to 239. Each takes 5 Rugged Leather. Five Rugged Leather a craft. Specialisation (optional): at 225 and character level 40. Dragonscale: Peter Galen (Azshara) or Thorkaf Dragoneye (Badlands) wants 2 Tough Scorpid Breastplates, 2 Tough Scorpid Gloves (patterns drop from the Wastewander bandits in Tanaris) and 10 Worn Dragonscale. Elemental: Sarah Tanner (Searing Gorge) or Brumn Winterhoof (Arathi Highlands) wants 2 each of Heart of Fire, Globe of Water, Core of Earth and Breath of Wind. Tribal (from 235): Caryssia Moonhunter (Feralas) or Se'Jib (Stranglethorn Vale) wants a Wild Leather Vest and Helmet, after the Wild Leather quests from Pratt McGrubben or Jangdor Swiftstrider in Feralas. On Forever the specialisation patterns need a Tanning Rack. You can take only one; none is needed for 300, and the beta never tested them (it stopped at level 30).
  craft 19058 until 239

step Wicked Leather Gauntlets to 269
  tip Wicked Leather Gauntlets is orange at 239 (yellow 255, green 265, grey 275): about 39 crafts to 269. Each takes 8 Rugged Leather, 1 Black Dye and 1 Rune Thread. Eight Rugged Leather a craft; Black Dye and Rune Thread from leatherworking or tailoring vendors.
  learn 19049 -- from the recipe in your bags
